<title>UK: Cypriot freighter towed into Seychelles.</title>
<headline>Cypriot freighter towed into Seychelles.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The fire-stricken Cypriot-flag vessel Global Natali was towed into Port Victoria outer anchorage in the Seychelles on October 31, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The fire is still smouldering and the cargoes in holds no.6 and no.7 are damaged, it said.</p>
<p>The 17,659-dwt vessel is carrying cotton, rice, chemicals and firecrackers.</p>
